      "title": {
        "en": "Welcoming, knowledgeable clinicians treating families warmly"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients enthusiastically praise the veterinary team and front desk staff for their attentive, welcoming, and knowledgeable approach. Veterinarians like Dr. Ball and Dr. Ratcliff receive regular accolades for taking time to address all questions and treating clients like family. Pet parents appreciate that visits never feel hurried and that staff members consistently maintain a kind, patient demeanor."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 19,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle, stress-free handling for skittish pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers frequently emphasize how comfortable their pets feel during exams at this Upper West Side practice. Clients with nervous dogs, feisty chihuahuas, and skittish cats note that clinicians handle animals with remarkable gentleness and affection. Pet owners report that the calming environment helps even the most anxious pets remain settled during checkups and dental cleanings."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "place",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 5,
      "title": {
        "en": "Spacious, spotless new Columbus Avenue facility"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "The clinic's physical environment earns strong praise from recent reviewers. Pet owners highlight the new location on Columbus Avenue across from the Museum of Natural History, describing it as spacious, spotless, and easy to reach. Reviewers note that the clean and organized facility creates a soothing atmosphere that immediately helps both pets and their families feel relaxed upon arrival."
      }
    }
  ],
